{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8beddc98bba790506470b872593d40af3992972a3c4cdf164dd44bfa1ba421fd", "ja": "（今日は商店街とコラボしたお正月ライブだ！\nそろそろ本番だけど、海美の様子はどうかな）", "zh": "（今天是和商店街合作的新年演唱会！\n快要正式登台了，海美现在怎么样了呢）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "190b82c1fd9e5e7acf75aaf07dbf7ae5405acc47bb3fbe19eacd6e58b0c9b3a6", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！\nお疲れさま、そろそろ開演だよね？　楽しみ～♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n辛苦啦，差不多要开演了吧？好期待～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1002_p", "source_sha256": "adf888a7acca1f73bdfb3fcc918505e9dda800e94ce7b3b73790c9a0ad6ca51f", "ja": "お疲れさま、海美。\nかなりやる気になってくれてるみたいだな？", "zh": "辛苦了，海美。\n看来你干劲十足啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "6861caeeeb08d87ded8c5e809688f0a58fb0b8e5a2320c3fa423b6ad45459c57", "ja": "うん！　だって今日は私、\nお神輿の上に乗せてもらえるんでしょ？", "zh": "嗯！因为今天不是要让我坐到神轿上吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1004_p", "source_sha256": "18627f2249a88751221da55c1041a0f33145317cc124fe40514cdabda8d0191b", "ja": "ああ、そういう段取りになってるよ。", "zh": "嗯，流程就是这样安排的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "949501b60df7120dada160800d9a989768a509a9019c9660f7cee5d741817983", "ja": "それって、すっごく注目してもらえるよね？\n私、今日は目立ちたいなーって思ってて……。", "zh": "那样的话，就能得到超多关注，对吧？\n我今天想引人注目来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "ba9d9100968e6d70a72f594d637cc7b290f37d9fda876561eddd0bad55ccf529", "ja": "そうだ！　お神輿の上でバレエ、踊ってもいい？\nアラベスクとか、ピルエットとか！", "zh": "对了！我可以在神轿上跳芭蕾吗？\n像阿拉贝斯克、皮鲁埃特之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8256b6c1ccc9d40d93004b1e543badeedf9267079b8519d8aa4abce407071da8", "ja": "え？　いや、それは……。\nさすがに危ないから、やめような。", "zh": "诶？不，那个……。\n毕竟太危险了，还是别跳了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "a4cbcbcd68e3f13694a1f3026f9d2a621fd5f99e72af4d6fad3194dd42f2c8d6", "ja": "えーっ、ダメ？\n私、バランス感覚には自信あるんだけどな～。", "zh": "诶——不行吗？\n我对自己的平衡感还是很有信心的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "df2e6a93e5a81ae8c39715fde3e2674fd0caa8def8cd1505d4342fff7a06c7db", "ja": "あ、でも、上に乗ってる私があんまり動くと、\n下で担ぐ人たちが大変だよね……。", "zh": "啊，不过，站在上面的我如果动得太厉害，\n在下面抬着的人会很辛苦吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "6eb80e13ef6e69b8d7cc0c526cab307908bdfccda2473e84e764a5f07ab19f3e", "ja": "うーん、動かないで、もっと目立つ方法……。\nあ、ポーズで！？", "zh": "嗯——不动的话，怎么才能更显眼呢……\n啊，用姿势来吸引注意！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2a625a171752e875a011625023b2e2bb195a8469e482fbdcc922a315ff91434c", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと待ってくれ。そもそも、\n今日はどうして、そんなに目立つことにこだわるんだ？", "zh": "等、等一下。说起来，今天为什么非要这么引人注目不可？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "e1fc3e832469fbd3e375ccfba162ddab6c2fd0d543980d3fef58412ac06bc3c0", "ja": "あ、実はね……えへへ♪\n今お姉ちゃんが、お正月休みで帰ってきてるんだ☆", "zh": "啊，其实呢……嘿嘿♪\n我姐姐现在正好放新年假回来了☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1013_p", "source_sha256": "83457ac8dd94df6cd2503af1787afa910a31d67f55d480c0420879b9637ea754", "ja": "えっ、お姉さんが？", "zh": "诶，你姐姐回来了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "a717342a45354914659233cb8f514d02028ed175115d9437694ed7322e55092f", "ja": "うん！　それでね、今日のライブって、\nTV中継もされるでしょ？", "zh": "嗯！所以啊，今天的演唱会也会在电视上直播，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "7a07610da01d14fbdb606835e00abcd340c2932fd2433823228407c7f148eb34", "ja": "お姉ちゃん、見たいって言ってたから。\n私、今日はいっぱい映りたいなーって！", "zh": "因为姐姐说她想看嘛。  \n所以我今天想多多上镜——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5f733d29d0f812f81838ba295e3f3cbbffc2c1d760e049b2a4e368161b101b5b", "ja": "そうだったのか……なんだかゴメンな。\nお正月なのに、仕事入れちゃって。", "zh": "原来是这样……总觉得有点对不起你。明明是过年，却还给你安排了工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "d86e2d3f8941e5cae6b0f068077f53946c4080cd1e7e5c43728b1d87f79b4534", "ja": "ううん、いいの！　私がお仕事がんばってるって、\nお姉ちゃんに見てもらえると嬉しいから♪", "zh": "不会呀，没关系的！能让姐姐看到\n我努力工作的样子，我也会很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "f2b3fd37f5828d308c0a7afd9006ef15056150b5a234d7e72c9edbc208274bc7", "ja": "だから{$P$}、\nどうやったら目立てるか、一緒に考えてっ！", "zh": "所以，{$P$}，\n我们一起想想该怎么做才能引人注目吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1019_p", "source_sha256": "49c254c0a39d5a093407e3124bf787490549462478c217376a20063b6b4fc5e7", "ja": "それなら、ただ乗ってるだけで十分だと思うよ。\nTVクルーも目立つように撮ってくれるはずだ。", "zh": "那样的话，我觉得光是骑着就足够显眼了。\n电视台的工作人员应该也会把你拍得很醒目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1020_p", "source_sha256": "c0c04d9d9a0087e4cd0cae86c24377a6e2ba832d7f6fb642c88b2cf5f9240b70", "ja": "なんたって、今日の主役は海美だからな！", "zh": "毕竟，今天的主角可是海美啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "3724a716ad24aeb157a251bf4fe9c7f9b978ab93721fd08ca10bdde386dfd80e", "ja": "私が、主役……そっか！\n今日は私、センターみたいなものなんだね！", "zh": "我是主角……原来如此！\n今天的我，就像是站在中心位置一样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "8d1a649e102252371127d86645bd1bfc492c28f99abcdf91fb569cbf55282498", "ja": "ううう～、なんか私、ますます燃えてきたかも！\nじゃあ、行ってくるね☆", "zh": "唔唔唔～，我好像越来越燃起来了！\n那我这就去啦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1023_p", "source_sha256": "899198bc60654e3678d2b5b6cffe432522c30c17fe7cd2494afedff69288e781", "ja": "おっと、もうそんな時間か……ああ、頑張ってな！", "zh": "哎呀，已经这么晚了啊……嗯，加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "680adb05793a1ec0b5422f1c936bca2920f54c6dfaff3c14a28e471ff17a797c", "ja": "あっ！　っとっと……言い忘れてたっ！", "zh": "啊！哎呀呀……差点忘了说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1025_p", "source_sha256": "502003443ef1e25eedf698b3ae03c969903cbdb988387ea54de88caa857475e8", "ja": "ん？　どうした？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0174_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "845a30bf8466d64c41318d06564c3d381e6cad9f6198fa9685315e5918b801b3", "ja": "えへへ……{$P$}！\n今年も一年、よろしくお願いしまーすっ☆", "zh": "嘿嘿……{$P$}！\n今年也请多多关照啦——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
